    \"Chimera the Flying Mythical Beast\" on your field or in your GY: You can activate
    1 of these effects;\r\n\u25CF Add this card to your hand.\r\n\u25CF Banish this
    card, and if you do, Special Summon both 1 \"Gazelle the King of Mythical Beasts\"
    and 1 \"Berfomet\" from your Deck and/or GY.\r\nYou can only use this effect
    of \"Chimera Fusion\" once per turn."
